 [00:10:02\u8211\'9600:10:15]\line And I just said, do you want me to guess? Because I can't\u8212\'97 I, I see them on, you know, with each eye. And, and I had never been able to see through binoculars or, you know, the little kaleidoscope thing that\u8212\'97}
