David Kaufer}{
 [00:20:54\u8211\'9600:21:07]\line Okay. But that's remarkable that you recovered that quickly. Do you attribute it to the the homeopathic approach that you took, or just your, you know, were there other steps that you took that maybe helped accelerate it?}
