Denise Allen}{
 [00:21:07\u8211\'9600:21:33]\line Uh, I think that that's what I've typically attributed it to, but I also am really healthy, and mindset also plays into it. The fact that I had never had a surgery before made it easier. You know, people who've had other strabismus surgeries, there's scar tissue that It's going to get in the way and it makes it a harder process.}
