 [00:21:33\u8211\'9600:21:52]\line No, that makes a lot of sense. You know, earlier you were talking about how it affects, you know, roughly 5% of the general population, but that the percentage is a lot higher when you're talking about the neurodiverse or the autistic population. Do you have any estimates of how high it is?}
