Denise Allen}{
 [00:22:00\u8211\'9600:22:28]\line The Hidden Link Between Vision and Learning by Wendy Rosen. She's one of my podcast guests, and, and I\u8212\'97 oh great, I knew she had told me this, and, or that I had read it, and so I looked it up. And, um, it says according to her that about 25% of children in the, in the United States struggle with learning problems, and then 25% of children also have a vision problem that impedes learning. So let's see maybe there's a connection there, right?}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
