 [00:22:28\u8211\'9600:22:29]\line Mm-hmm.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
Denise Allen}{
 [00:22:29\u8211\'9600:22:57]\line And according to the National Center for Health Statistics, 20 to 25% of children enter school with significant vision problems. So, and that's, I mean, that's not just strabismus, that's other vision issues, right? The greatest difficulty among learning disabled children is with reading, which is affecting 75% of that population. And 80% of these children struggle with one or more visual skills.}
