David Kaufer}{
 [00:24:18\u8211\'9600:24:33]\line And she didn't think it was\u8212\'97 I want to say weird, you know, but different. She didn't think anything about reading the way that she read, for example. Like, that was just the way it was. You just, you know, cover up one eye and roll over and do the other eye. And that's just the\u8212\'97 yeah, that's just what you do.}
