David Kaufer}{
 [00:24:35\u8211\'9600:24:52]\line So what role does neuroplasticity play in vision? I mean, what, you know, when it comes to this, like you said, it's not just, you know, looking 20/20. Are there\u8212\'97 are the therapies\u8212\'97 vision therapy, does that deal with issues with the brain in terms of training the brain as well?}
