 [00:50:30\u8211\'9600:50:39]\line I think we just take that for granted, not just as a parent, but as a person alive on the earth today. We just think everyone sees like we do.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
David Kaufer}{
 [00:50:39\u8211\'9600:50:42]\line Yeah, right. You just assume that.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
Denise Allen}{
 [00:50:42\u8211\'9600:50:56]\line I've talked to so many people, they don't even know what binocular vision means. And I say, well, I didn't see in 3D before. And they say, well, do I see in 3D? I said, well, Probably. I don't know.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
David Kaufer}{
 [00:50:56\u8211\'9600:50:57]\line I can't tell you.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
Denise Allen}{
 [00:50:58\u8211\'9600:50:59]\line I can't see like you do.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
