Denise Allen}{
 [00:59:30\u8211\'9600:59:51]\line I gave up. That's, that's my big confession, actually. I don't\u8212\'97 I hardly ever talk about it. Yeah, it's still\u8212\'97 I mean, he doesn't\u8212\'97 if he wants to do something, he figures out how to do it. He's very smart. He can do whatever he wants to, but schoolwork is not it.}
