Denise Allen}{
 [01:00:01\u8211\'9601:00:10]\line He does, yeah. And I've told him that many times, you know, you can go back and do the vision therapy and get the results if you want to.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
David Kaufer}{
 [01:00:10\u8211\'9601:00:51]\line Yeah, well, that I could see where that, that would be really difficult. But there's only so much that you can do too, right? I mean, that's, that's the part that I think we all struggle with as parents is, you know, we want to be able to control as much as we can. We want to be able to boost our kids and help them. I was just having that conversation with my brother, um, the other day.\line It's, it's a, it's a really tough balancing act between, like I said, pushing too hard or, you know, and pulling back too far too. And unfortunately, there's no, uh, there's no perfect answer, right? You just do it. You just do what you think is best.}
