 [01:03:24\u8211\'9601:03:25]\line Right.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
Denise Allen}{
 [01:03:25\u8211\'9601:03:41]\line Like, it doesn't matter if you're 50 or 70 or 20, right? It can change. And so My gift is that I've proven it can change. You know, I gained 3D vision at age 54.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\kerning1\cf0\rtlch\af6\afs24\alang1081\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang1033\dbch\af8\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang1033\ql\ltrpar{\b
